<li><a id="n2"></a>Federal Open Market Committee, <a href="https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/monetary20220126c.htm" target="_blank">&ldquo;Principles for Reducing the Size of  the Federal Reserve&rsquo;s Balance Sheet,&rdquo;</a> Jan. 26, 2022; Federal Open Market Committee, <a href="https://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/pressreleases/monetary20220504b.htm" target="_blank">&ldquo;Plans for Reducing the Size of the  Federal Reserve&rsquo;s Balance Sheet,&rdquo;</a> May 4, 2022. </li>
